      "comparisonSentence": "Grilled fish and clear broth (Garang Asem) options provide superior lean protein and omega-3 fatty acids with significantly lower trans and saturated fats than deep-fried alternatives.",
      "message": "These grilled fish selections and sour clear soups represent the most cardiometabolic-friendly choices on the menu. They deliver high-quality lean protein, essential omega-3 fats, and minimal batter or oil absorption. Perfect for maintaining stable blood lipids and supporting lean body mass.",
      "orderingTip": "Opt for 'Ikan Bakar' without sweet soy glaze (kecap manis) to keep added sugars minimal, and pair with fresh raw vegetables (lalapan). averageNutrients: calories 450, protein 35, totalFat 12, saturatedFat 2.5, sodium 550, carbohydrates 45, sugar 3, addedSugar 1"
