      "comparisonSentence": "Grilled poultry offers good protein density compared to heavy fried dishes, though marinades and sambal oils require moderate caution.",
      "message": "Poultry dishes like grilled chicken provide solid protein content without the massive trans-fat load of deep-fried options. However, watch out for added oils in sambal accompaniments and sugary marinades that can subtly elevate glycemic and caloric totals.",
      "orderingTip": "Ask for sambal served separately and limit consumption of sugary dipping sauces. averageNutrients: calories 520, protein 32, totalFat 18, saturatedFat 4, sodium 650, carbohydrates 48, sugar 5, addedSugar 3"
