      "message": "These carbohydrate-heavy street foods and spicy cracker stews (seblak) are exceptionally high in sodium, MSG, and refined starches. They trigger rapid blood glucose spikes and water retention, making them unsuitable for individuals managing hypertension, pre-diabetes, or metabolic syndrome.",
